# DE AI engineering governance

Mandatory authority: `docs/AI-ENGINEERING-GOVERNANCE.md`.

Before any implementation:

1. read `AGENTS.md`;
2. read `docs/AI-ENGINEERING-GOVERNANCE.md`;
3. inspect `.ai/ACTIVE_WORK.yaml` and current open PRs/branches;
4. fetch current `origin/main` and record its SHA;
5. use an isolated branch/worktree;
6. claim non-overlapping work before editing.

Cursor is a **specialist implementation agent by default**, not an independent website integration authority. Claude Code is the default lead website implementation/integration agent unless Joe explicitly reassigns that role for a specific task.

Do not merge or deploy website work unless Joe explicitly authorizes the exception. Do not edit a subsystem already claimed by another active agent. Do not resolve overlap by blindly replacing whole files.

For UI work, inspect the actual rendered context before changing it and verify at 390 / 768 / 1440. Code correctness is not visual acceptance.

`MERGED` != `LIVE`. Production must be verified separately.
